<title>USA: TABLE-Sun Healthcare sells $250 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sun Healthcare sells $250 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Sun Healthcare Group Inc was priced on Tuesday via lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Sun Healthcare operates or manages long-term care facilities in the United Kingdom and the United States. The company is based in Albuquerque, New Mexico.</p>
<p>BORROWER SUN HEALTHCARE GROUP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT   MATURITY 7/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 1/01/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.50 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD 299 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
